<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"
      xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="ProgId" content="Word.Document">
  <meta name="Generator" content="Microsoft Word">
  <title>Candidate CV Template</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 1.8cm;
    }

    body {
      color: #24343a;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 10.5pt;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #123f46;
      font-size: 24pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 18pt 0 8pt;
      padding-bottom: 4pt;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #137c7c;
      color: #123f46;
      font-size: 12pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5pt;
    }

    h3 {
      margin: 8pt 0 2pt;
      font-size: 11pt;
    }

    p {
      margin: 3pt 0;
    }

    ul {
      margin: 5pt 0 8pt 20pt;
    }

    .role {
      margin: 3pt 0 8pt;
      color: #137c7c;
      font-size: 13pt;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .contact {
      padding: 8pt;
      background: #eef7f6;
    }

    .hint {
      color: #6b7478;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .date {
      float: right;
      color: #56646a;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    td {
      padding: 3pt 8pt 3pt 0;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>[FULL NAME]</h1>
  <p class="role">[PROFESSIONAL TITLE]</p>

  <div class="contact">
    <table>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Email:</strong> [name@example.com]</td>
        <td><strong>Phone:</strong> [+84 ...]</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Address:</strong> [City, Country]</td>
        <td><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> [https://linkedin.com/in/...]</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>GitHub:</strong> [https://github.com/...]</td>
        <td><strong>Portfolio:</strong> [https://...]</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
  <p class="hint">
    Write 3-5 sentences describing your experience, strengths, career direction, and the value
    you can bring to an employer.
  </p>

  <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
  <p><strong>Programming languages:</strong> [JavaScript, TypeScript, Java, ...]</p>
  <p><strong>Frameworks and libraries:</strong> [React, NestJS, Spring Boot, ...]</p>
  <p><strong>Databases and tools:</strong> [PostgreSQL, Docker, Git, ...]</p>

  <h2>Soft Skills</h2>
  <p>[Communication, Teamwork, Problem solving, Time management, ...]</p>

  <h2>Languages</h2>
  <p>[English - IELTS 7.0]</p>
  <p>[Japanese - N3]</p>

  <h2>Work Experience</h2>
  <h3>
    [POSITION] - [COMPANY]
    <span class="date">[YYYY-MM] - [Present or YYYY-MM]</span>
  </h3>
  <ul>
    <li>[Describe a responsibility or project using a strong action verb.]</li>
    <li>[Describe a measurable achievement, for example: improved processing time by 30%.]</li>
    <li>[Mention relevant technologies, team size, or business impact.]</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>
    [POSITION] - [COMPANY]
    <span class="date">[YYYY-MM] - [YYYY-MM]</span>
  </h3>
  <ul>
    <li>[Responsibility or achievement]</li>
    <li>[Responsibility or achievement]</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Education</h2>
  <h3>
    [DEGREE] - [MAJOR]
    <span class="date">[YYYY-MM] - [YYYY-MM]</span>
  </h3>
  <p>[SCHOOL / UNIVERSITY]</p>
  <p class="hint">Optional: GPA, scholarship, relevant coursework, or academic achievements.</p>

  <h2>Additional Information</h2>
  <p><strong>Certifications:</strong> [Certification name - Issuing organization - Year]</p>
  <p><strong>Projects:</strong> [Project name, role, technologies, and result]</p>
  <p><strong>Activities:</strong> [Volunteer work, clubs, awards, or professional memberships]</p>
</body>
</html>
